WEBVTT

02:02.680 --> 02:09.600
IT WON'T BE LONG
UNTIL WE RETURN TO CHANG'AN

02:33.080 --> 02:35.240
In the 28th year of Qiansheng,

02:35.760 --> 02:38.000
the founding emperor fell ill suddenly

02:38.080 --> 02:40.000
and passed away unexpectedly.

02:40.080 --> 02:43.160
General of the Huben Army, Yan Fengshan,
took control of the imperial court

02:43.240 --> 02:45.000
and threw the government into chaos.

02:45.080 --> 02:48.360
He helped the late emperor's youngest son,
Xiao Wenjing, ascend the throne

02:48.920 --> 02:50.360
and killed the feudal lords,

02:50.880 --> 02:53.040
causing imperial authority to decline.

02:55.000 --> 02:56.520
In the 4th year of Wencheng,

02:57.040 --> 02:59.960
the late emperor's eldest son,
a feudal lord, Xiao Wuyang,

03:00.040 --> 03:01.680
mobilized troops from the north

03:01.760 --> 03:04.480
to overthrow the tyranny.

03:04.560 --> 03:06.360
They traveled 1,300 li southward.

03:06.440 --> 03:08.200
With strict military discipline
along the way,

03:08.280 --> 03:10.080
all sides submitted to him.

03:10.840 --> 03:12.080
He arrived in Chang'an,

03:12.160 --> 03:13.720
eliminated the treacherous officials,

03:14.240 --> 03:16.800
and took control of the imperial court.

03:39.440 --> 03:42.120
TAIQING PALACE

04:04.400 --> 04:08.200
XIAO WUYANG, NEW EMPEROR

04:10.480 --> 04:13.880
Unable to bear the defeat,
the deposed emperor, Xiao Wenjing,

04:13.960 --> 04:17.680
burned himself inside Taiji Hall.

04:37.560 --> 04:40.000
Your Highness,
there were five dead bodies.

04:40.080 --> 04:41.280
None of them were the deposed emperor.

04:41.360 --> 04:44.720
GU YU, MARQUIS OF NORTHGUARD

04:45.680 --> 04:47.120
Have you verified all of them?

04:47.200 --> 04:50.600
The deposed emperor fell
on a Hanbaiyu staircase as a child.

04:51.200 --> 04:53.400
Because of that,
his upper left molar was chipped.

04:53.480 --> 04:55.960
He also fractured his left leg.

04:56.040 --> 04:57.600
All of this is recorded
in the palace archives.

04:58.440 --> 05:00.240
These dead bodies might be unrecognizable,

05:00.920 --> 05:03.280
but it is not difficult
to verify these injuries.

05:06.520 --> 05:09.360
Your Highness, we just pulled this
from one of the corpses.

05:26.280 --> 05:29.560
It finally turned up.

05:30.280 --> 05:31.880
It was set up on purpose.

05:32.400 --> 05:35.240
They are waging war against Xiao Wuyang.

05:39.600 --> 05:41.400
All subordinates
of the city-guarding general,

05:41.480 --> 05:42.840
Li Longjing, have surrendered.

05:42.920 --> 05:44.720
There might still be
skirmishes in the city,

05:44.800 --> 05:46.440
but it's nothing to worry about.

05:46.520 --> 05:48.320
We've captured
all 12 gates of the Capital.

05:48.400 --> 05:49.760
We will set up camps

05:49.840 --> 05:52.040
in the south and southwest.

05:52.120 --> 05:55.640
Moreover, the north side of the city
is under our army's control.

05:55.720 --> 05:56.680
The north is secure.

05:58.280 --> 06:01.960
What about Yan Fengshan and his army?

06:11.160 --> 06:12.120
Greetings, Your Majesty.

06:21.000 --> 06:23.360
WISDOM AND DEPTH

06:23.440 --> 06:26.000
The scene at Taiji Hall has been examined.

06:26.960 --> 06:28.520
The deposed emperor, Xiao Wenjing,

06:28.600 --> 06:30.600
did not die in the fire.

06:32.480 --> 06:35.040
This was recovered from the stomach

06:35.120 --> 06:38.200
of one of the dead bodies in Taiji Hall.

06:38.960 --> 06:42.600
I'm sure Your Majesty
recognizes the token.

06:57.320 --> 06:59.040
A Huben Token.

07:00.400 --> 07:01.520
Does it mean

07:02.360 --> 07:06.240
he has abducted
that useless brother of mine?

07:06.320 --> 07:07.480
Yes.

07:08.560 --> 07:10.360
Xiao Wenjing might be useless,

07:10.440 --> 07:12.960
but one can rule the world
simply by abducting the emperor.

07:14.320 --> 07:17.800
Perhaps this battle is far from over.

07:18.520 --> 07:22.320
Perhaps it is just the beginning.

07:23.720 --> 07:26.280
Yan Fengshan and the Huben Army
have decided to stay hidden

07:26.360 --> 07:28.600
because they do not want
to face Your Majesty directly.

07:29.280 --> 07:31.600
But as long as
the deposed emperor is in his hands,

07:31.680 --> 07:34.000
he will surely rise again.

07:35.080 --> 07:39.160
A hidden battle will soon begin.

08:13.920 --> 08:15.640
I am old.

08:15.720 --> 08:16.840
I was careless.

08:18.120 --> 08:20.320
When you are facing Yan Fengshan,

08:20.840 --> 08:25.080
no one can win in one move.

08:25.840 --> 08:27.480
I do recommend one particular person

08:28.400 --> 08:29.840
if you plan to face the Huben Army.

08:30.920 --> 08:34.240
He understands the army better
than anyone in this world.

08:34.320 --> 08:36.280
His father, Liu Ziwen,

08:36.360 --> 08:38.320
is the founder of the Huben Army.

08:38.400 --> 08:39.679
Fifteen years ago,

08:39.760 --> 08:43.520
Yan Fengshan led the Huben Army
and betrayed Liu Ziwen.

08:46.520 --> 08:48.720
The Liu clan was annihilated.

08:50.960 --> 08:54.160
He was fortunate enough to survive.

08:56.600 --> 08:58.440
He is an exceptional talent.

08:59.400 --> 09:01.880
Moreover, he carries a grudge.

09:02.400 --> 09:05.720
After 15 years, he is now fully prepared.

09:05.800 --> 09:10.360
Many former retainers of the Liu clan
are also helping him secretly.

09:10.440 --> 09:12.240
An exceptional talent?

09:13.080 --> 09:14.160
How does he compare to you?

09:14.240 --> 09:16.000
I am old.

09:16.080 --> 09:17.360
I'm inferior to him.

09:24.640 --> 09:26.520
In that case, bring him to me.

09:27.760 --> 09:29.400
I will test him myself.

09:30.000 --> 09:31.000
Understood.

09:31.520 --> 09:35.320
HUAINAN

09:46.720 --> 09:47.720
Be careful with that.

09:48.560 --> 09:50.320
There's more over here.

09:50.400 --> 09:52.600
Have some water.

09:54.920 --> 09:57.200
In times of turmoil,

09:57.280 --> 09:59.200
the government stalls
and the people suffer.

09:59.280 --> 10:01.280
Extraordinary individuals will arise

10:01.360 --> 10:03.080
like leopards and magpies.

10:03.160 --> 10:05.000
With the momentum of soaring eagles,

10:05.080 --> 10:06.560
they achieve remarkable feats.

10:06.640 --> 10:11.440
Therefore, extraordinary accomplishments
require extraordinary people.

10:11.520 --> 10:13.080
How extraordinary.

10:13.600 --> 10:15.080
As extraordinary as I am ignorant.

10:15.840 --> 10:17.360
No need for you to understand.

10:17.440 --> 10:18.800
As long as I

10:18.880 --> 10:21.240
and the officials above me understand it.

10:21.320 --> 10:22.560
Just listen to these sentences.

10:23.400 --> 10:26.720
Divide and reclaim the land
to rebuild the realm.

10:27.400 --> 10:29.080
With Heaven's mandate to crush the rebels,

10:29.160 --> 10:30.440
no rebellion can stand.

10:30.520 --> 10:32.360
With righteous deeds to attain merit,

10:32.440 --> 10:34.200
all great feats may be accomplished.

10:34.720 --> 10:36.560
The sentences are magnificent

10:36.640 --> 10:39.080
and every word is exquisite.

10:39.160 --> 10:41.560
All of you are bumpkins.

10:41.640 --> 10:42.960
Don't even dream of writing that,

10:43.040 --> 10:44.160
not in this life or the next.

10:45.680 --> 10:49.720
Sir, we specialize in repairing roofs
and catching chickens

10:49.800 --> 10:51.000
for the residents.

10:51.080 --> 10:53.280
You cannot compare us to them.

10:53.360 --> 10:54.560
Exactly, sir.

10:54.640 --> 10:56.040
Yes.

10:56.120 --> 10:57.000
That's right, sir.

10:57.080 --> 10:59.360
Sir! Sir!

10:59.440 --> 11:00.760
What is it?

11:00.840 --> 11:01.920
The imperial envoy is near the city gates.

11:03.400 --> 11:05.040
All of you, pull yourselves together.

11:05.640 --> 11:08.040
Come with me to meet the imperial envoy.

11:08.120 --> 11:10.320
Huai'an? Where is our beloved Huai'an?

11:12.360 --> 11:13.320
Huai'an!

11:14.720 --> 11:15.800
Huai'an!

11:22.480 --> 11:24.880
Huai'an! The imperial gazette is here!

11:25.920 --> 11:29.640
XIE HUAI'AN

11:31.280 --> 11:32.920
Be careful.

11:35.960 --> 11:37.000
I just got it.

11:39.880 --> 11:42.000
That's all you harvested after half a day?

11:44.560 --> 11:45.800
The weather is good today.

11:45.880 --> 11:47.640
I'm letting the paddy dry in the sun.

11:48.400 --> 11:50.560
Sure. If you say so.

11:51.160 --> 11:52.880
I've read the imperial gazette.

11:52.960 --> 11:54.560
The latest issue is from a month ago.

11:55.840 --> 11:57.560
It's fine even if it's late.

11:57.640 --> 11:59.760
At least, we know
what is happening out there.

12:00.400 --> 12:03.920
Huainan is remote and desolate.

12:04.440 --> 12:07.400
What happens outside
has nothing to do with this place.

12:25.320 --> 12:26.720
The weather is changing.

12:28.520 --> 12:31.440
Yes. Rain is coming
from behind the mountain.

12:33.440 --> 12:35.840
Ziya. Look at this article.

12:39.120 --> 12:43.040
It has been a month since Xiao Wuyang
attacked Xigu Mountain City.

12:44.360 --> 12:46.240
After passing Xigu Mountain City,

12:46.320 --> 12:49.240
it's only 300 li from Chang'an.

12:50.120 --> 12:51.280
There is no choke point in between

12:53.280 --> 12:54.800
to defend against any attack.

12:56.080 --> 12:59.480
I'm sure Chang'an
won't be captured so easily.

12:59.560 --> 13:01.800
The Imperial Guards
are in charge of Chang'an's defense.

13:02.320 --> 13:05.600
The soldiers are all from noble families.

13:05.680 --> 13:09.560
They have adequate military strength,
but look at General Li.

13:09.640 --> 13:11.280
His name is Li Longjing.

13:11.880 --> 13:13.640
He is a coward.

13:14.360 --> 13:17.920
Chang'an might have been captured already.

13:18.000 --> 13:21.160
That's impossible.
An imperial envoy has come from Chang'an.

13:21.840 --> 13:23.720
Zhou Mo is probably waiting at the gates

13:23.800 --> 13:25.160
with your proclamation against the rebels.

13:25.800 --> 13:26.880
What?

13:33.040 --> 13:35.640
HUAINAN

13:35.720 --> 13:37.800
Sir, what's taking them so long?

13:37.880 --> 13:38.800
Waiting on your wife?

13:38.880 --> 13:40.120
How fast do you want them?

13:40.200 --> 13:41.880
You are useless.

13:44.880 --> 13:47.680
HUAINAN DISTRICT OFFICE

13:52.320 --> 13:54.080
What is it? Is the imperial envoy here?

13:55.240 --> 13:57.120
I wrote a tribute for the new emperor.

13:57.200 --> 13:58.040
Help me find it, now.

13:58.120 --> 14:01.480
There's no congratulatory article here.
Didn't you write to condemn the rebels?

14:01.560 --> 14:03.280
Zhou Mo took it
to meet the imperial envoy.

14:03.360 --> 14:04.880
That article must not be submitted.

14:04.960 --> 14:06.200
One and a half months ago,

14:06.280 --> 14:07.920
Xiao Wuyang took Xigu Mountain City.

14:08.000 --> 14:10.640
The city is only 300 li away
from Chang'an.

14:11.240 --> 14:12.840
There's no choke point left to stop him.

14:12.920 --> 14:15.160
I'm sure Chang'an
won't be captured that easily.

14:15.240 --> 14:16.920
It has already been captured.

14:17.000 --> 14:18.840
The imperial envoy serves the new emperor.

14:18.920 --> 14:21.960
If Zhou Mo submits the article,
we'll all be dead.

14:22.040 --> 14:23.480
-That's…
-Enough.

14:23.560 --> 14:24.800
Look for it, quickly.

14:25.840 --> 14:27.160
When did you write it?

14:27.240 --> 14:28.480
Two years ago.

14:28.560 --> 14:30.400
Two years ago?
Are you some kind of prophet?

14:33.120 --> 14:34.200
Found it.

14:34.280 --> 14:36.200
They are here. Play the music!

14:36.280 --> 14:37.200
Quick, sound the drum.

14:44.120 --> 14:45.600
Why does he look like a eunuch?

14:45.680 --> 14:48.000
Look like a eunuch? He is a eunuch.

14:48.080 --> 14:49.560
It's my first time seeing one.

14:49.640 --> 14:51.440
Stop talking from now on.

14:59.560 --> 15:02.200
I, the Magistrate of Huainan District,
Zhou Mo,

15:02.280 --> 15:04.200
greet the imperial envoy.

15:05.880 --> 15:07.360
You may stand, Magistrate.

15:07.440 --> 15:09.760
Thank you, Imperial Envoy.

15:18.120 --> 15:20.840
Huainan District is so remote.

15:20.920 --> 15:23.520
I think I've traveled
70 li of mountainous roads

15:23.600 --> 15:25.320
to arrive here from the county.

15:25.400 --> 15:29.240
Sir, Huainan might be remote,

15:29.320 --> 15:32.160
but every land here
belongs to the emperor.

15:32.240 --> 15:36.360
The people of Huainan
are also blessed by His Majesty's grace.

15:36.440 --> 15:38.160
You have a silver tongue.

15:38.240 --> 15:39.200
Imperial Envoy,

15:39.280 --> 15:42.960
I've prepared the best inn
in the district town

15:43.040 --> 15:45.960
to give you a warm welcome.

15:47.280 --> 15:48.800
That's right. One more thing.

15:48.880 --> 15:52.760
We have prepared an article
for you to peruse

15:52.840 --> 15:54.280
when you arrive.

15:54.880 --> 15:55.720
Show me.

16:15.480 --> 16:17.920
Sorry, sir. Are you hurt?

16:18.000 --> 16:19.040
How absurd!

16:19.120 --> 16:20.440
Which…

16:22.200 --> 16:23.520
He's one of our own.

16:23.600 --> 16:24.920
Sorry, Imperial Envoy.

16:25.560 --> 16:26.680
I am the registrar here.

16:26.760 --> 16:28.680
I apologize for my reckless action.

16:28.760 --> 16:30.040
I'm very sorry.

16:35.880 --> 16:37.360
Sorry.

16:37.440 --> 16:40.280
Sir, this is
the congratulatory article you wrote.

16:40.360 --> 16:42.400
Please show it to the imperial envoy.

16:50.440 --> 16:51.560
Sir.

17:01.320 --> 17:03.360
What a good article. How impressive.

17:04.880 --> 17:07.400
I've traveled across the realm
and read 80 tributes

17:07.480 --> 17:08.800
celebrating His Majesty's ascension.

17:08.880 --> 17:10.560
This is the best one yet.

17:12.280 --> 17:14.160
Mr. Zhou,
your literary talent is remarkable.

17:14.240 --> 17:17.400
You shouldn't humble yourself
in this desolate place.

17:17.480 --> 17:18.319
When I return,

17:18.400 --> 17:21.160
I will put in a good word
to His Majesty for you.

17:24.359 --> 17:26.440
Thank you, sir.

17:27.800 --> 17:30.400
Oh. Beyond declaring the new emperor,

17:30.480 --> 17:31.640
I had one more task.

17:31.720 --> 17:34.960
I also traveled to your district
for one more purpose.

17:35.040 --> 17:36.320
Do tell, sir.

17:36.400 --> 17:39.240
Do you have someone called Xie Huai'an
in your district?

17:40.520 --> 17:44.280
His Majesty has summoned Xie Huai'an
to the Capital.

17:48.440 --> 17:49.360
I am Xie Huai'an.

17:59.840 --> 18:01.720
The imperial envoy said

18:02.240 --> 18:06.760
your journey to the Capital
would be paid for by the district office.

18:06.840 --> 18:10.440
We must ensure a comfortable trip for you
in terms of food and accommodation.

18:11.560 --> 18:12.960
Thank you, sir.

18:13.960 --> 18:15.640
He also said

18:16.560 --> 18:18.880
that when you arrive in Chang'an,

18:18.960 --> 18:21.680
an academic named Li
from the Imperial Academy

18:21.760 --> 18:23.200
will be there to receive you.

18:24.000 --> 18:29.120
This man is famous in the Capital.

18:29.640 --> 18:31.400
He will welcome you in person.

18:34.600 --> 18:36.760
The imperial envoy also said…

18:36.840 --> 18:38.080
He said something else?

18:38.600 --> 18:42.640
His Majesty is going to meet Huai'an
in person

18:43.880 --> 18:47.080
and order him to do something huge.

18:47.960 --> 18:52.080
The imperial envoy
wants you to depart tomorrow

18:52.600 --> 18:55.000
without any delay.

18:56.360 --> 18:57.440
Huai'an,

18:57.520 --> 19:02.360
you said you'd be my registrar forever.

19:03.160 --> 19:05.640
Enough. Stop pouring.
He is completely drunk.

19:05.720 --> 19:07.080
It's fine.

19:08.360 --> 19:09.640
I'm going to leave anyway.

19:09.720 --> 19:12.040
Tonight, just let him drink
to his heart's content.

19:14.200 --> 19:15.240
Zhou Mo,

19:16.200 --> 19:17.600
I used to tell you

19:18.200 --> 19:20.600
I'd either be your registrar forever,

19:22.800 --> 19:24.200
or head straight to the court.

19:25.560 --> 19:27.160
I won't choose any other path.

19:28.360 --> 19:29.640
Before today,

19:30.160 --> 19:32.320
I thought I'd stay in Huainan forever.

19:34.600 --> 19:37.760
You are a good superior
and a good friend of mine.

19:41.800 --> 19:44.600
Being your registrar isn't that bad.

19:50.800 --> 19:53.200
Sir, why are you crying?

19:53.720 --> 19:55.360
He sounds so devoted.

19:55.880 --> 19:58.560
My friend is loyal.

19:58.640 --> 20:01.520
What's wrong with me
crying just for a while?

20:03.400 --> 20:09.400
I believe you will complete
His Majesty's task dutifully.

20:10.120 --> 20:11.400
Right?

20:12.160 --> 20:16.880
The two of us will soon meet again.

20:18.840 --> 20:20.040
Right?

20:21.760 --> 20:22.640
That's right.

20:24.640 --> 20:28.640
But it might not be necessary
to return here just to reunite.

20:34.160 --> 20:35.600
This is a farewell gift.

20:36.880 --> 20:40.200
I don't know if your career as an official
will be smooth in the future.

20:40.280 --> 20:44.240
But if you are no longer an official
one day,

20:45.120 --> 20:46.840
open this letter.

20:47.640 --> 20:50.760
It'll be easier
for us to gather in the future.

20:51.800 --> 20:52.840
All right.

20:54.160 --> 20:55.480
Let's make a toast to Huai'an.

20:55.560 --> 20:56.640
-Sure!
-Drink up!

20:56.720 --> 20:58.760
Huai'an, may you soar to great heights.

20:58.840 --> 21:01.400
Huainan is good

21:01.480 --> 21:04.080
A safe haven

21:04.160 --> 21:09.760
The mountains and rivers
Stretch on like our affection

21:09.840 --> 21:10.720
An affectionate person…

21:10.800 --> 21:12.040
When you were 17 years old,

21:12.120 --> 21:14.600
you carried a tattered pack

21:14.680 --> 21:17.200
and came to Huainan, a remote place,

21:17.280 --> 21:19.280
like a homeless man.

21:19.360 --> 21:21.120
You worked as a registrar for seven years,

21:21.200 --> 21:22.840
and served four magistrates.

21:22.920 --> 21:25.880
When they left, they wanted
to take you with them but you refused.

21:25.960 --> 21:30.120
All of us knew
you were destined for great things.

21:31.120 --> 21:34.760
We treated you well
not because we wanted you to help us out

21:34.840 --> 21:38.800
when you achieved success one day,
but we did so out of sincerity.

21:40.960 --> 21:44.200
However, you are also aloof.

21:46.160 --> 21:47.240
Yes.

21:47.320 --> 21:49.080
But that's who I am.

21:55.520 --> 21:57.240
Are you that happy?

21:58.880 --> 22:01.000
Lie here and count the stars
as your punishment.

22:07.760 --> 22:09.240
Stars!

22:09.800 --> 22:12.880
Stars, why are you so far away?

22:14.640 --> 22:16.400
You are as far as Chang'an.

22:16.920 --> 22:18.560
Enough already.

22:24.000 --> 22:28.640
Do you know
why I only have two paths to choose from?

22:30.400 --> 22:31.640
Why?

22:41.040 --> 22:42.520
I am a descendant of a condemned official.

22:44.360 --> 22:48.040
Fifteen years ago,
my family was wronged and annihilated.

22:49.720 --> 22:51.680
I was fortunate enough to survive.

22:52.560 --> 22:54.920
Since then, I've been living in hiding.

22:55.520 --> 22:57.560
I slept in the wilderness.

22:59.440 --> 23:01.640
I've lived in the reed swamps.

23:05.840 --> 23:07.360
Had I taken one wrong step

23:09.120 --> 23:10.960
back in those days,

23:12.440 --> 23:14.160
I would have been dead.

23:14.680 --> 23:17.320
Did your family
offend some powerful figures?

23:20.320 --> 23:22.000
The dynasty's most powerful man.

23:23.720 --> 23:25.280
The leader of the Huben Army,

23:26.960 --> 23:28.120
Yan Fengshan.

23:29.120 --> 23:30.240
Yan Fengshan?

23:30.760 --> 23:33.280
His influence spreads
across the imperial court.

23:33.360 --> 23:35.720
But times have changed.

23:36.520 --> 23:40.640
Xiao Wuyang ascended
to the throne as a general.

23:41.520 --> 23:43.360
He won't have Yan Fengshan around.

23:45.400 --> 23:47.000
I don't know what he wants me to do,

23:48.040 --> 23:50.120
and I don't know who recommends me.

23:51.080 --> 23:52.640
But this is my opportunity.

23:54.240 --> 23:56.240
I must grasp it.

24:04.640 --> 24:05.840
Huai'an.

24:06.360 --> 24:09.240
Are you trying
to clear your family's name?

24:19.920 --> 24:21.240
Everyone is dead.

24:23.000 --> 24:24.600
There's no use clearing their name.

24:28.840 --> 24:30.480
I'm going to take revenge.

24:43.080 --> 24:45.000
All right. Go back and rest.

24:45.080 --> 24:46.160
Sleep for six hours.

24:46.240 --> 24:47.800
We'll send you off
at the city gates in the morning.

24:48.400 --> 24:49.360
Sure.

24:49.440 --> 24:50.680
You all should rest too.

24:50.760 --> 24:51.840
Sure.

24:57.520 --> 25:00.040
Enough. Don't be sad.

25:00.120 --> 25:01.280
I'm leaving.

26:01.120 --> 26:02.160
Father!

26:04.240 --> 26:05.440
-Go!
-Father!

26:06.840 --> 26:08.480
Father!

26:08.560 --> 26:09.560
Go!

26:25.320 --> 26:27.080
Go!

26:47.160 --> 26:48.560
Move a little.

26:53.120 --> 26:55.640
You came back late
and you're still not sleeping?

26:55.720 --> 26:57.400
-The sun is coming up.
-I'm not sleeping.

26:59.200 --> 27:00.120
Why are you taking eggs?

27:00.720 --> 27:01.960
Huai'an leaves for the Capital tomorrow.

27:02.040 --> 27:03.200
I want to give him some eggs.

27:03.280 --> 27:06.320
Here, cook the eggs
so he can take them with him on his way.

27:06.400 --> 27:08.320
The journey to the Capital is long.

27:08.400 --> 27:10.200
Cooked eggs go rotten in a few days.

27:11.000 --> 27:11.840
What should we do?

27:11.920 --> 27:13.440
Just give him some fresh eggs.

27:13.520 --> 27:14.800
When he feels like eating them,

27:14.880 --> 27:17.720
he just needs to start a fire,
boil some water, and cook them.

27:17.800 --> 27:19.240
You are right.

27:19.320 --> 27:20.960
As expected of my wife.

27:21.040 --> 27:22.320
-Move.
-What's wrong?

27:22.400 --> 27:23.720
You have no idea, do you?

27:23.800 --> 27:25.640
The chickens will lay eggs in a while.

27:25.720 --> 27:27.120
We can give Huai'an more.

28:00.680 --> 28:04.440
CONGRATULATIONS
ON YOUR MAJESTY'S ASCENSION

28:12.920 --> 28:16.120
CONGRATULATIONS
ON YOUR MAJESTY'S ASCENSION

29:00.240 --> 29:01.280
What?

29:02.440 --> 29:03.880
Are you sad to see me go

29:05.160 --> 29:06.920
and want me dead instead?

29:11.680 --> 29:12.960
Go inside.

29:24.360 --> 29:25.400
Sit down.

29:43.960 --> 29:44.800
You've read it?

29:48.760 --> 29:50.600
News is hard to come by in Huainan.

29:51.400 --> 29:55.600
I deduced what happened in Chang'an
by using old imperial gazettes.

29:56.800 --> 29:58.560
But you already knew things had changed.

29:59.840 --> 30:01.520
And your name, Zhou Mo,

30:05.640 --> 30:06.480
must be a pseudonym.

30:07.320 --> 30:08.440
I am with the Huben Army.

30:12.520 --> 30:13.880
Huai'an, I didn't lie to you.

30:15.120 --> 30:16.480
I didn't lie to Haoran or the rest.

30:17.080 --> 30:21.240
What I have been showing all of you
is my true character.

30:22.160 --> 30:25.000
However, I was a member of the Huben Army
before I met all of you.

30:26.520 --> 30:29.200
General Yan Fengshan saved me.

30:29.280 --> 30:32.200
I pledged my loyalty to him.

30:32.840 --> 30:35.040
When you were talking
about your background,

30:35.120 --> 30:36.760
I was shocked.

30:37.800 --> 30:39.560
I did not expect my friend

30:40.600 --> 30:42.640
to be a descendant of Liu Ziwen.

30:43.680 --> 30:46.120
Is fate playing a joke on me?

30:46.640 --> 30:47.680
Huai'an.

30:48.360 --> 30:50.120
I might be one of the Huben Army's men,

30:50.200 --> 30:53.720
but I've never killed anyone until today.

30:54.560 --> 30:58.760
I did not expect the first person
I would kill to be my friend.

30:59.360 --> 31:01.520
This cruel fate.

31:02.520 --> 31:05.440
The imperial court must be crawling

31:06.640 --> 31:07.880
with shadow agents.

31:07.960 --> 31:09.800
Indeed.

31:10.680 --> 31:14.000
They are like a shapeless net

31:14.520 --> 31:17.320
that hangs above the imperial court.

31:18.000 --> 31:19.680
You will never win against them.

31:22.480 --> 31:24.320
This is indeed a cruel joke.

31:25.040 --> 31:29.280
I thought I'd become a registrar
here forever,

31:31.200 --> 31:32.800
but to my surprise…

31:36.160 --> 31:37.120
Forget it.

31:52.080 --> 31:53.000
Here.

31:53.920 --> 31:55.920
Drink this farewell wine.

31:56.000 --> 31:58.440
Forget that we've ever met.

31:58.520 --> 32:00.120
Live or die, we'll have no regrets.

32:00.200 --> 32:01.720
A cup for life

32:02.840 --> 32:04.240
and a cup for death.

32:10.160 --> 32:11.480
Come, Huai'an.

32:22.440 --> 32:23.480
Life

32:27.280 --> 32:28.520
for you.

33:01.040 --> 33:02.680
When I was young,

33:04.280 --> 33:06.160
my mother died in the north.

33:07.400 --> 33:08.840
When I was ten years old,

33:09.640 --> 33:11.520
my father died as well.

33:15.760 --> 33:19.680
The whole Huben Army
defected and killed him.

33:20.360 --> 33:21.880
I can't die.

33:24.240 --> 33:26.520
I must get revenge on the Huben Army.

33:27.520 --> 33:29.600
I'll kill any Huben soldiers I see

33:31.040 --> 33:33.240
until none of them are left.

33:42.960 --> 33:44.880
I collected the eggs for him.

33:45.400 --> 33:46.840
Are you sure?

33:46.920 --> 33:49.360
-I'm sure it was your wife who did that.
-I did it.

33:50.560 --> 33:51.600
Huai'an.

33:51.680 --> 33:52.600
-We are here to send you off.
-Huai'an.

33:52.680 --> 33:53.800
-Look what we brought.
-Huai'an!

34:04.640 --> 34:05.520
What happened?

34:15.120 --> 34:15.960
Zhou Mo.

34:16.880 --> 34:18.159
-Sir!
-What happened?

34:20.760 --> 34:21.639
Don't ask.

34:22.719 --> 34:24.159
It's not his fault.

34:25.760 --> 34:27.800
Don't tell anyone.

34:29.600 --> 34:30.600
Don't…

34:31.440 --> 34:33.400
Don't trouble him.

34:34.560 --> 34:35.480
We all

34:37.239 --> 34:38.880
have our own reasons.

34:40.440 --> 34:41.560
Zhou Mo.

34:41.639 --> 34:42.639
-Zhou Mo.
-Sir!

34:43.239 --> 34:44.320
Zhou Mo!

34:45.400 --> 34:46.840
-Sir!
-Sir!

34:48.000 --> 34:49.080
Sir!

34:58.040 --> 34:58.960
What have you done?

34:59.040 --> 35:01.000
That's Zhou Mo!

35:03.840 --> 35:05.000
Stay away from me

35:07.120 --> 35:09.160
if you don't want to die.

36:12.000 --> 36:13.560
AUTUMNAL EQUINOX:
THUNDER BEGINS TO SOFTEN

36:13.640 --> 36:15.600
INSECTS MAKE NESTS,
AND WATER BEGINS TO SOLIDIFY

36:34.160 --> 36:37.920
The river runs cold. The chill cuts deep.

36:38.760 --> 36:41.240
Travelers, move along.

36:41.320 --> 36:44.240
Those near the riverbank,
stay away from the shore.

36:52.920 --> 36:54.440
You truly surprise me.

36:59.600 --> 37:01.400
This place could cost you your life.

37:01.920 --> 37:03.400
Why did you come back?

37:04.600 --> 37:06.240
Only one person is buried here.

37:06.760 --> 37:08.280
It's not a dangerous place.

37:09.440 --> 37:13.280
The real danger is Chang'an,
70 li away from us.

37:13.960 --> 37:15.800
It seems you truly are only passing by.

37:17.240 --> 37:20.800
I won't be sharing this fish
with you then.

37:24.400 --> 37:25.880
I'm going back to Chang'an.

37:27.480 --> 37:29.320
I don't know if I'll leave alive.

37:31.000 --> 37:32.640
So, I came to see you

37:34.120 --> 37:35.280
before I enter Chang'an.

37:45.600 --> 37:46.800
Right.

37:48.240 --> 37:51.120
You are bound to return one day.

37:55.640 --> 37:56.480
Yes.

37:57.720 --> 38:00.680
Your younger sister
went to Chang'an as well.

38:01.200 --> 38:02.880
She went to study.

38:03.480 --> 38:05.680
Perhaps she is an imperial scholar now.

38:09.760 --> 38:10.760
I know.

38:11.680 --> 38:13.320
Both of you are so far apart.

38:13.840 --> 38:15.000
How did you know?

38:16.240 --> 38:18.040
She has been writing letters to me.

38:19.040 --> 38:20.040
I've been writing back too.

38:20.120 --> 38:22.080
Why wouldn't you reunite with her?

38:28.480 --> 38:29.800
I dare not.

38:31.400 --> 38:33.320
It is best that we never reunite.

38:34.960 --> 38:36.040
None of my family

38:37.960 --> 38:39.880
ended up well.

38:45.800 --> 38:47.080
The people of the Liu clan

38:48.360 --> 38:49.960
suffer a harsh fate.

38:52.920 --> 38:54.840
Her name has been changed.

38:57.320 --> 38:59.000
Hopefully, she can live her life in peace.

38:59.080 --> 39:01.480
You've changed your name as well.

39:03.320 --> 39:04.840
You must be safe.

39:06.640 --> 39:07.800
Come.

39:54.440 --> 39:56.680
CHANG'AN

40:04.920 --> 40:08.200
Mr. Huai'an,
we are both here to pick you up.

40:10.640 --> 40:12.040
Winter starts today. Snow is falling hard.

40:12.120 --> 40:13.600
Thank you, both.

40:14.360 --> 40:16.360
-Mister, let me carry it.
-Open the gates.

40:19.080 --> 40:20.120
This way.
